<title>HONG KONG: HK land auction-Repulse Bay site gets HK$230 mln.</title>
<headline>HK land auction-Repulse Bay site gets HK$230 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>A 2,008-square-metre site in Repulse Bay on the south side of Hong Kong island slated for luxury residential purposes sold for HK$230 million at a Hong Kong government land auction on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Analysts and property consultants had forecast it would sell for between HK$179 million and HK$188 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
